    {
      "id": "claim_02260b9d041440448fda65b10f4bc46c",
      "statement": "Connection setup is offer-link driven: the offer peer generates an RTCPeerConnection, data channel, and SDP offer (waiting up to 3 seconds for ICE candidates), while the answer peer decodes the offer from the URL, generates the answer plus RSA key pair (when encrypted), and returns the answer code; the channel opens on both sides once the offer peer accepts it.",
